program OneName
arg --text
status 2
output
Error: Argument required for option --text
onename [options]

  -t <arg>
      String option with short name only.
  --text <arg>
      String option with long name only.
  -n <arg>
      Integer option with short name only.
  --number <arg>
      Integer option with long name only.
